# op::unique
# ==========
# Extracts invariant cryptographic and perceptual identifiers from an audio work
# so ownership can be proven even after transcoding, resampling, or AI remixing.

unique(audio_asset) -> identifiers:
  1. exact_sha256      : Raw byte digest of the lossless master / stem.
  2. perceptual_hash   : 256-bit temporal-spectral log-energy differential hash
                         across 32 geometric sub-bands (80 Hz - 8 kHz).
  3. stem_tree_digests : Per-stem harmonic/onset fingerprints to prove compositional
                         derivation when stems are isolated or rearranged.
